'''Santiago''' ({{Literal translation|[[w:Saint James|Saint James]]}}) is a major underground [[W:Interchange station|interchange station]] of the [[Castejón Metro]], serving the [[Commune of Castejón|''Centro'']] barrio on the [[Castejón Metro Güevéjar Line|Güevéjar]] and [[Castejón Metro Cartajima Line|Cartajima]], [[Castejón Metro Iznájar Line|Iznájar]], [[Castejón Metro Huerta Line|Huerta]] and [[Castejón Metro Takamaicán Line|Takamaicán]] lines.

The station takes it's name from the [[Misión Santiago de Los Kuarupíba]], a [[Colonial Balisca|colonial-era]] mission founded by [[W:Jesuits|Jesuits]] in the area.{{Castejón}}{{Balisca articles}}
